  {
    "index": 3,
    "hash": "WfvPZw1OiGd9O4B6Lat54dgIDUo=",
    "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-19T11:23:39.100Z",
    "action": {
      "type": "SET_CONTENT",
      "input": {
        "content": "The n8n integration is the least exotic in the corpus: an HTTP Request node posting a typed mutation on each branch of the workflow. No plugin, no SDK, no custom node \u2014 the node that already exists is enough, which makes this the cheapest demo to stand up of any tool cohort in this slice.\n\nThe demonstration is the destructive step. Prune n8n's execution data, then show the invoice's decision history still intact and replayable from Powerhouse. The reason that step is persuasive rather than contrived is recorded in the paired fit finding for the same seven leads: n8n's execution pruning is on by default, so the demo does not stage an unusual failure, it performs the product's normal behaviour and shows what is lost.\n\nSeven leads carry this demo and all seven are German \u2014 Stuttgart (two), Karlsruhe, Wiesbaden, Hamburg, Hamburg/Berlin and one with an unverified HQ. One is at \"1 \u00b7 start here\" and six at \"3 \u00b7 later\". A single-geography cohort with a zero-code integration point is a reasonable candidate for one reference build shown to all of them.\n\n---\n\n## Leads sharing this finding (7)\n\n**1 \u00b7 start here**\n- ETES GmbH (DE Stuttgart) \u2014 Markus Espenhain, Gesch\u00e4ftsf\u00fchrer \u00b7 info@etes.de \u00b7 https://etes.de\n\n**3 \u00b7 later**\n- Exxeta AG (DE Karlsruhe) \u2014 https://exxeta.com\n- Lighthouse Consultings (DE Stuttgart) \u2014 https://lighthouseconsultings.de\n- SVA System Vertrieb Alexander GmbH (DE Wiesbaden +29) \u2014 https://sva.de\n- bitbetter GmbH (DE Hamburg) \u2014 https://bitbetter.de\n- cimt ag (DE Hamburg + Berlin) \u2014 https://cimt-ag.de\n- relyon AG (wemakefuture) (DE (HQ unverified)) \u2014 https://wemakefuture.com\n\nVerbatim research text this claim was extracted from:\n\n> n8n workflow with an HTTP Request node posting a typed mutation on each branch. Prune n8n execution data, then show the invoice's decision history still intact and replayable.",
        "updatedAt": "2026-08-19T11:23:39.100330Z"
      },
      "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-19T11:23:39.100335Z"
    }
  },
